{
 "_comment": "Generative real-time video on the kiosk (first device run, 2026-10-13, over powerline Ethernet). source=cuda renders a GPU fractal per frame (worst case for the encoder). Needs a CuPy venv (requirements-lab.txt). Primary candidate = HEVC 4K30 over MSE (plan D11 / P6A). Panels run 3840x2160@60 since 2026-10-13 (one X screen per TV).",
